## Technical Considerations

### Polish Character Support
Ensure all fonts and systems support Polish diacritics:
```css
/* Current font from layout.tsx */
font-family: "Figtree", sans-serif;
/* Supports: ą, ć, ę, ł, ń, ó, ś, ź, ż */
```

### Responsive Polish Text
- Polish words tend to be longer than English
- Consider text wrapping and responsive design
- Test CTAs and buttons with Polish text lengths

### Form Validation Messages
```typescript
// Error messages in Polish
const validationMessages = {
  required: "To pole jest wymagane",
  email: "Wprowadź prawidłowy adres email",
  phone: "Wprowadź prawidłowy numer telefonu",
  name: "Wprowadź imię i nazwisko"
};
```

