### Contact and Quote Forms
- **Personal Data**: Name, phone, email (GDPR required)
- **Project Details**: Property type, measurements, preferences
- **Contact Preferences**: Phone vs email, preferred time
- **Privacy Policy**: Required GDPR compliance checkbox

## Compliance and Legal

### GDPR Requirements
- Clear privacy policy link
- Consent checkboxes for data processing
- Cookie policy notification
- Data retention and deletion policies

### Polish Business Standards
- Company registration details in footer
- Tax identification numbers (NIP)
- Professional certifications display
- Quality guarantees and warranties

### Accessibility (Polish Standards)
- Screen reader compatibility with Polish text
- Keyboard navigation support
- Alt text in Polish for images
- High contrast support for text readability